| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| SSH alias | `macmini` (configured in `~/.ssh/config` on dev machine) |
| LAN IP | `192.168.1.5` |
| Public IP | `59.167.129.31` |
| User | `jcastilla` |
| macOS | 26.x (Apple Silicon / arm64) |
